    "body": "### Generated by Generative AI\n\n_No response_\n\n### Operating System:\n\nUbuntu Noble\n\n### ROS version or commit hash:\n\nRolling\n\n### RMW implementation (if applicable):\n\nrmw_cyclonedds_cpp\n\n### RMW Configuration (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### Client library (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### 'ros2 doctor --report' output\n\n_No response_\n\n### Steps to reproduce issue\n\n1. Go to https://build.test.ros2.org/job/Rci__nightly-cyclonedds_ubuntu_noble_amd64\n2. Build a job\n3. see the test failing\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nTo build without test regression\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nBuilding with test regression\n\n### Additional information\n\n### Reference Build\n- https://build.test.ros2.org/job/Rci__nightly-cyclonedds_ubuntu_noble_amd64/280\n\n### Failing test\n- projectroot.test_wait\n\n### Log Output\n```\n[ RUN      ] TestActionClientWait.test_wait_set_add_action_client\n/tmp/ws/src/ros2/rcl/rcl_action/test/rcl_action/test_wait.cpp:64: Failure\nValue of: rcutils_error_is_set()\n  Actual: true\nExpected: false\nrmw_subscription_get_content_filter: unimplemented, at /tmp/ws/src/ros2/rmw_cyclonedds/rmw_cyclonedds_cpp/src/rmw_node.cpp:3255\n\n\n>>> [rcutils|error_handling.c:109] rcutils_set_error_state()\nThis error state is being overwritten:\n\n  'rmw_subscription_get_content_filter: unimplemented, at /tmp/ws/src/ros2/rmw_cyclonedds/rmw_cyclonedds_cpp/src/rmw_node.cpp:3255'\n\nwith this new error message:\n\n  'wait_set argument is null, at /tmp/ws/src/ros2/rcl/rcl_action/src/rcl_action/action_client.c:533'\n\nrcutils_reset_error() should be called after error handling to avoid this.\n<<<\n[  FAILED  ] TestActionClientWait.test_wait_set_add_action_client (6 ms)\n[ RUN      ] TestActionClientWait.test_client_wait_set_get_num_entities\n/tmp/ws/src/ros2/rcl/rcl_action/test/rcl_action/test_wait.cpp:64: Failure\nValue of: rcutils_error_is_set()\n  Actual: true\nExpected: false\nrmw_subscription_get_content_filter: unimplemented, at /tmp/ws/src/ros2/rmw_cyclonedds/rmw_cyclonedds_cpp/src/rmw_node.cpp:3255\n```\n\n### Flakyness 15 days\njob_name | last_fail | first_fail | build_count | failure_count | failure_percentage\n|--|--|--|--|--|--|\nRci__nightly-cyclonedds_ubuntu_noble_amd64 | 2026-03-18 | 2026-03-11 | 16 | 8 | 50.0\n\nIm not sure if this broke the test, but `https://github.com/ros2/rcl/pull/1294` seems that changed things related to `rcl_action`\n\nCC: @Crola1702 ",
